{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事、真夏の全国ツアー2016と\n4th year birthday live\n完走いたしました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥と。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/09/01/3720368/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張り屋の踏ん張り屋さん\nお疲れ様ね(｡･ω･｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに足を運んでくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変なときもくじけそうなときも\nやっぱりステージに立って\nみなさんの笑顔を見ると\n何にも代え難い力が\nどこからともなく湧いてきて\n自然と私も笑顔になれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は無理だと思ったところから\nまだもう一段階も二段階も\n上へ行けることも\nこのライブで学びました(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらゆる人からの言葉を受けて\n更にそう感じています(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/09/01/3720368/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はでこぴんでは\nまいまいのポジションを\nやらせていただいたりもして\nすごく緊張したんだけど\n途中からその緊張が気持ちよくて\n気付いたら笑顔が溢れてました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口約束は初披露！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4人で向き合って\n歌うところが大好きだったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/09/01/3720368/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"揃って歌えた嬉しさを\nしっかり噛み締めながら☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にあの場に立ててよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天候は毎日安定しない状況でしたが\nみなさん雨具で対応してくれたり\n雨の中でも負けないくらいの声援を\n送ってくれたり、\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないようにね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/09/01/3720368/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人でデコ出し(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"35人全員で迎えたラストの景色は\nとても素敵で輝いていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ乃木坂は登り続けます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな本当にありがとう(*^^*)"}],"source":"archive"}